  <body>
    <section name="Scope Components">
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Controllers</strong>
        <br>  
          Handle the presentation logic
        </br>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <strong>Controls</strong> 
            <br>  
              Messages from the Model and the View to the Controller, and from the Controller
              to its parent Controllers
            </br>  
          </li> 
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Models</strong> 
        <br>  
          Usually a standard JavaBean. Contains the data to display in the View.
        </br>  
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>View</strong> 
        <br>  
          Displays the business data, and interact with the user.
        </br>  
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Scope wrapper objects - SObjects</strong>
        <br>  
          Subclasses of standard Swing components adapted for Scope.
        </br>  
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p/>
